    "Nagoya University Program For Academic Exchange (NUPACE) : Partner Institutions\nJP\nWhat is NUPACE?\nNUPACE in Brief\nAbout Nagoya University\nFaculty and Staff\nFacts and Figures\nPartner Institutions\n15th Anniv. & Alumni Reunion 2011\n10th Anniv. & Alumni Reunion 2006\nAcademic Programme\nAcademic Policy & Grades\nCourses & Syllabi\nNUPACE Academic Policy & Course Guide Archive\nAcademic Calendar\nSchools & Graduate Schools\nInt'l Student Advising Offices\nFloor Maps\nApplying\nEligibility\nStudent Status\nApplication Procedures\nOnline Application\nStudent Life\nFinancial & Scholarship Information\nAccommodation\nLiving in Japan\nCampus Life\nNU Life Guide\nStudent Column\nOrientation Resources\nPre-arrival Information\nIntroductory Orientation\nAcademic Orientation\nReturning Home Orientation\nFor NU Faculty/Staff\nFor Faculty Members & Administrative Staff\nEnquiries/Links\nFAQ\nContact\nLinks\nNUPACE Prospectus\n2026-27 (5.8 MB)\nOfficial PR Video\nNUPACE in Brief\nAbout Nagoya University\nFaculty and Staff\nFacts and Figures\nPartner Institutions\n15th Anniv. & Alumni Reunion 2011\n10th Anniv. & Alumni Reunion 2006\nTop Page\n>\nWhat is NUPACE?\n> Partner Institutions\nPartner Institutions\nApplicants to NUPACE must be enrolled in universities having concluded academic exchange agreements with Nagoya University at either the inter-university or inter-school level. Students enrolled in departments having concluded an\ninter-school/faculty\nagreement will be affiliated to the respective partner school at Nagoya University.\nPartner Institutions\nInter-university Agreements\nPartner Institutions\nInter-school Agreements\nNUPACE, Global Engagement Centre\nNagoya University\nFuro-cho, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya\n464-8601, JAPAN\n[Site Map]\nNUPACE Office\nGlobal Engagement Centre\nNagoya University\nFuro-cho, Chikusa-ku, Nagoya\n464-8601, JAPAN\nCopyright © Nagoya University\nCopyright © Nagoya University"
